      <comment>change to TLAdisambig, wkfy per manual of style</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''PEI''' is an [[initialism]] for:

* [[Prince Edward Island]], a Canadian province situated in the Maritimes.
* [[Playboy Enterprises]], an American media company best known for publishing ''Playboy'' magazine.
* [[Polyetherimide]], a thermoplastic polymer
* The [[ISO 4217]] code for the [[inti (currency)|inti]], a currency adopted by Peru in mid-1985 during the [[Alan García]] presidency, replacing the over-inflated [[Peruvian nuevo sol|sol]].
* Percutaneous [[ethanol]] injection

==See also==
* [[Pei]]

{{TLAdisambig}}</text>
    </revision>
