      <text xml:space="preserve">:''This article is about the city. For the song, see ''[[Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania (song)]]''. For other places, see [[Pittsburg]].''
[[Image:PittSkyline082904.jpg|350px|thumb|right|Pittsburgh skyline as viewed from [[Mount Washington (Pittsburgh)|Mount Washington]]]]
'''Pittsburgh''' is a city in [[Western Pennsylvania]], [[United States]], and the county seat of [[Allegheny County, Pennsylvania|Allegheny County]]. As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 334,563 ([[metropolitan area]] 2,358,695), making it the second-largest city in the state. For many years the center of the American [[steel]] industry, Pittsburgh is nicknamed ''The Steel City'' or ''The Iron City.''
