[[de:Polyhistor]]
[[fr:Polymathe]]
[[it:Uomo universale]]
[[nl:Uomo universale]]
[[nn:Polyhistor]]
[[fi:Yleisnero]]
[[pt:Polímata]]
[[sv:Universalgeni]]
[[zh:文藝復興人]]</text>
