      <text xml:space="preserve">[[Image:Prayer_wheels.jpg|thumb|right|Prayer wheels bring good luck]]
[[Image:Prayer wheels in Samye.jpg|thumb|right|Prayer wheels in Samye]]
'''Prayer wheels''' are called '''Mani wheels''' by the [[Tibetans]].  A prayer wheel is a wheel on a spindle, and on the wheel are written or encapsulated [[prayer]]s or [[mantra]]s.  According the [[Tibetan Buddhism|Tibetan Buddhist]] belief, spinning such a wheel will have much the same effect as orally reciting them.

==External links==
{{commons|Prayer wheel}}
* [http://www.dharma-haven.org/tibetan/prayer-wheel.htm http://www.dharma-haven.org/tibetan/prayer-wheel.htm]


