* [http://www.britishpubguide.com/cgi-bin/pubsearch.cgi?results:Cornwall_&amp;_Scilly_Isles:2949 The Harbour Inn]
* [http://www.britishpubguide.com/cgi-bin/pubsearch.cgi?results:Cornwall_&amp;_Scilly_Isles:2100 The London Inn]
* [http://www.britishpubguide.com/cgi-bin/pubsearch.cgi?results:Cornwall_&amp;_Scilly_Isles:1583 The Olde Custom House]
* [http://www.britishpubguide.com/cgi-bin/pubsearch.cgi?results:Cornwall_&amp;_Scilly_Isles:1301 The Old Ship]
* [http://www.britishpubguide.com/cgi-bin/pubsearch.cgi?results:Cornwall_&amp;_Scilly_Isles:1302 The Shipwrights]

====Other external links====
