      <text xml:space="preserve">{{Cheese|Pizza
| No Image Available
| [[United States of America]]
| Varies
| [[Cow]]s
| Frequently
| soft/melted
| Varies
| No}}
'''Pizza cheese''' is a specific [[cheese]] designed to melt well on [[pizza]] while remaining chewy. It is commonly used on commercially produced pizzas in the [[United States|United States of America]] where it is often mistaken for [[Mozzarella]]. Pizza cheese is formulated so that it can be made with basic cheesemaking equipment but without the additional equipment and processing that true mozzarella requires.

[[Category:American cheeses]]
[[Category:Pizza]]

