      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Pinuccio Sciola''' ([[1942]]-) is a sculptor from [[San Sperate]], [[Sardinia]]. He is known for his activity in promoting ''murales'' (decorative paintings on building façades) and made his town famous for this form of art.

