      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Punta Sardegna''' is a panoramic site on the coast of northern [[Sardinia]], near [[Porto Rafael]], [[Palau, Sardinia|Palau]].

A curious air force observatory with a view on Bocche di Bonifacio and [[La Maddalena]].
