      <text xml:space="preserve">The '''State of Qatar''' ([[Arabic language|Arabic]]: ''' قطر''' [English: '''kût'ər''']), an [[emirate]] in the [[Middle East]], occupies the small [[Qatar Peninsula]] which is part of the larger [[Arabian Peninsula]]. It borders [[Saudi Arabia]] to the south; otherwise the [[Persian Gulf]] surrounds the country.

* The pronunciation of ''Qatar'' in [[English language|English]] varies; see [[list of words of disputed pronunciation]].

{| border=1 align=right cellpadding=4 cellspacing=0 width=300 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 1em 1em; background: #f9f9f9; border: 1px #aaaaaa solid; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 95%;&quot;
